description = "Libretro port of the OpenBOR beat 'em up engine containing five official releases (v3.0 Build 3711, v3.0 Build 4153, v3.0 Build 6391, v4.0 Build 7555, v4.0 Build 8025), plus build 8025 with WebM video playback (8025_webm). The engine is chosen per game from the contents of the .pak (or forced with the Engine version core option or a [ob<engine>] tag at the end of the file name, e.g. 'SORX [ob8025_webm].pak'); if it cannot load the game the next one is tried. Load a mod .pak file as content. Settings, high scores and saved games go to <save directory>/OpenBOR/<engine>/."
